1
00:00:00,850 --> 00:00:06,530
A human video shows fingers moving around a cup, but never measures their contact forces.
视频能看到手指绕杯运动，却没有测量接触力。

2
00:00:07,210 --> 00:00:13,050
DEX-X uses simulated interaction to recover supervision that ordinary video cannot directly provide.
DEX-X用仿真交互补充普通视频缺失的监督。

3
00:00:13,631 --> 00:00:18,871
First, reconstruct the hand and object motion from a monocular human demonstration.
首先，从单目人类示范重建手与物体运动。

4
00:00:19,431 --> 00:00:26,131
Retargeted references guide a simulated robot, while physical contacts generate additional force information.
重定向参考引导仿真机器人，接触产生额外力信息。

5
00:00:26,857 --> 00:00:33,697
A reinforcement-learning teacher receives reference motion, object state, and tactile contact information.
强化学习教师读取参考运动、物体状态和触觉。

6
00:00:34,317 --> 00:00:40,377
This privileged input makes skill learning easier inside simulation, where otherwise hidden quantities are available.
仿真提供现实中难直接观测的信息，帮助学习技能。

7
00:00:41,052 --> 00:00:46,572
The teacher is distilled into a student using point clouds, touch, and proprioception.
教师蒸馏为使用点云、触觉和本体状态的学生。

8
00:00:47,152 --> 00:00:53,372
Deployment still uses the retargeted motion reference; the policy is not instruction-only general intelligence.
部署仍用重定向运动参考，并非仅靠语言任意操作。

9
00:00:53,927 --> 00:00:56,952
Real experiments use a Franka FR3 arm
真机采用Franka FR3机械臂，

10
00:00:56,967 --> 00:00:59,647
with a SharpaWave hand and fingertip force sensing.
搭配SharpaWave手与指尖力感知。

11
00:01:00,187 --> 00:01:04,467
The policy runs at thirty hertz without task-specific real-world fine-tuning.
策略30赫兹运行，无需任务专用真机微调。

12
00:01:04,989 --> 00:01:10,849
Thirty attempts per task yield twenty-eight successful cube picks and twenty-four successful pours.
每任务30次，方块成功28次，倒水24次。

13
00:01:11,349 --> 00:01:16,609
Lifting a cup succeeds twenty-two times; sustained scraping succeeds sixteen times.
提杯成功22次，持续刮擦成功16次。

14
00:01:17,236 --> 00:01:22,676
Removing tactile input reduces cube success from twenty-eight to eleven out of thirty.
去掉触觉后，方块成功从28次降至11次。

15
00:01:23,176 --> 00:01:29,356
That is evidence about one sensory component, not a head-to-head comparison against another complete algorithm.
这是感知组件消融，并非与另一完整算法对决。

16
00:01:29,936 --> 00:01:34,336
Square-cube and duck variants fall to seven or eight successes out of thirty.
方形立方体与鸭子变体仅成功7或8次，共30次。

17
00:01:34,776 --> 00:01:39,236
A thin-cube variant reaches twenty-three, so geometry transfer is uneven.
薄立方体达到23次，说明几何迁移效果并不均衡。

18
00:01:39,902 --> 00:01:48,042
The central contribution is the bridge: reconstruct motion, generate contact supervision, then distill a sensory policy.
核心链路是重建运动、生成接触监督、蒸馏感知策略。

19
00:01:48,522 --> 00:01:52,862
The remaining challenge is reliable geometry transfer and prolonged tool contact.
难点仍是稳定的几何泛化和长期工具接触。
